What this does not do
---------------------

It grants you nothing with respect to Adobe's code. Obtaining the Illustrator
SDK, and complying with whatever agreement Adobe attaches to it, remains
entirely between you and Adobe. This exception only removes the GPL's objection
to the combination; it does not create a right to the other half of it.

It also does not weaken the GPL over Enhanced Free Distort itself. The source in
this repository, the test tools in tools/ (which link nothing and never needed
the exception in the first place), and any modification you make to either,
stay GPL-3.0-or-later.
